From 3c7c5d683344a623bf1d250732bc66e73afe55b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:32:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: profile photo upload and bio editing

- avatars Storage bucket with own-folder policies (2 MB, JPEG/PNG/WebP)
- 500-character bio limit in Postgres
- PATCH /api/profile/me for bio and photo URL, own-folder URL check
- Profile page editor: photo preview/upload/remove and bio
- Unit and integration tests
